`` Hard Habit to Break '' is a song written by Steve Kipner and John Lewis Parker , produced and arranged by David Foster and recorded by the group Chicago for their nineteen eighty-four  album Chicago  seventeen  , with Bill Champlin and Peter Cetera sharing lead vocals . Released as the second single from the album , it reached  number  three  on the Billboard Hot  one hundred  and was prevented from any more chart movement by `` Caribbean Queen ( No More Love on the Run ) '' by Billy Ocean and `` I Just Called To Say I Love You '' by Stevie Wonder . `` Hard Habit to Break '' also peaked at  number  three  on the Adult Contemporary chart . Overseas it peaked at  number  eight  on the UK Singles Chart . The record was nominated for the Grammy Award for Record of the Year and Best Vocal Arrangement for Two or More Voices , and won the Grammy Award for Best Instrumental Arrangement Accompanying Vocal ( s ) . 
