Elected in eighteen sixty-eight  , Republican President Ulysses S. Grant supported Congressional Reconstruction and enforced the protection of African Americans in the South through the use of the Enforcement Acts passed by Congress . Grant used the Enforcement Acts to effectively combat the Ku Klux Klan , which was essentially wiped out ( although a new incarnation of the Klan eventually would again come to national prominence in the nineteen twenty s ) , but was unable to resolve the escalating tensions inside the Republican party between the northerners on the one hand , and those Republicans originally hailing from the South on the other ( this latter group would be labelled `` Scalawags '' by those opposing Reconstruction ) . Meanwhile , `` Redeemers '' , self  minus  styled Conservatives ( in close cooperation with a faction of the Democratic Party ) strongly opposed reconstruction . They alleged widespread corruption by the Carpetbaggers , excessive state spending and ruinous taxes . Meanwhile , public support for Reconstruction policies , requiring continued supervision of the South , faded in the North , largely due to concerns over the Panic of eighteen seventy-three  . The Democrats , who strongly opposed Reconstruction , regained control of the House of Representatives in eighteen seventy-four  . In eighteen seventy-seven  , as part of a Congressional bargain to elect Republican Rutherford B. Hayes as president following the close eighteen seventy-six  presidential election , U.S. Army Troops were removed from the South , ending Reconstruction and allowing Democrats to return to power . 
