The Cavaliers  minus  minus  Warriors rivalry is a National Basketball Association ( NBA ) rivalry between the Cleveland Cavaliers and the Golden State Warriors . While the two teams have played each other since the Cavaliers joined the league in nineteen seventy  , their rivalry began to develop in the  two thousand fourteen   minus  minus   fifteen  season , when they met in the first of four consecutive NBA Finals series . Prior to the streak beginning , no pair of teams had faced each other in more than two consecutive Finals . Of these four series , the Warriors have won three championships (  two thousand fifteen  ,  two thousand seventeen  , and  two thousand eighteen  ) , and the Cavaliers won in  two thousand sixteen  . 
